        "k-Nearest neighbor classification",
        "Support Vector Machines",
        "Artificial neural networks including backpropagation",
        "Applications of classifications",
        "Ensembles of classifiers including bagging and boosting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "module-3",
      "number": 3,
      "title": "Hidden Markov Models and Sequence Classification",
      "topics": [
